<title>FINLAND: ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP POOL B STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>ICE HOCKEY-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP POOL B STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TURKU, Finland 1997-04-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>World ice hockey</p>
<p>championship Pool B standings after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>			 P  W  D  L  F  A Pts</p>
<p> 1. Sweden	   2  2  0  0 12  5   4</p>
<p> 2. U.S.	     1  1  0  0  5  4   2</p>
<p> 3. Canada	   2  1  0  1  9  7   2</p>
<p> 4. Latvia	   1  0  0  1  4  5   0</p>
<p> 5. Italy	    1  0  0  1  3  5   0</p>
<p> 6. Norway	   1  0  0  1  0  7   0</p>
<p>Top three qualify for medal round</p>
</text>
